```

This looks correct according to the issue description.

One more thing: the issue mentioned "JSON Schema 2020-12" and "OpenAPI 3.1.x".

If I look at the current implementation:
```python
    @classmethod
    def __get_pydantic_json_schema__(
        cls, core_schema: Mapping[str, Any], handler: GetJsonSchemaHandler
    ) -> dict[str, Any]:
        return {"type": "string", "format": "binary"}
```

The `__get_pydantic_json_schema__` method is used by Pydantic v2 to generate the JSON schema.

I've replaced `"format": "binary"` with `"contentMediaType": "application/octet-stream"`.

